{"code":"N3","wikidata":"Q4919845","wikipedia":{"en":"Victory Monument BTS station","th":"สถานีอนุสาวรีย์ชัยสมรภูมิ"},"summary":{"en":"Victory Monument station is a BTS skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Ratchathewi District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is located on Phaya Thai Road to the south of the Victory Monument, one of the landmark and major traffic intersection of Bangkok. The station is linked to all four corners of the traffic circle by a skybridge which almost traverses around the monument.","th":"สถานีอนุสาวรีย์ชัยสมรภูมิ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนพญาไทบริเวณด้านหน้าอนุสาวรีย์ชัยสมรภูมิ ในพื้นที่เขตราชเทวี กรุงเทพมหานคร เป็นหนึ่งในจุดต่อรถโดยสารจุดใหญ่ของกรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Victory_Monument_BTS_Station_1.jpg/960px-Victory_Monument_BTS_Station_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Victory_Monument_BTS_Station_1.jpg","author":"Mx. Granger","license":"CC0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_3.jpg/960px-Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_3.jpg","author":"kallerna","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_4.jpg/960px-Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_Skytrain_BTS_4.jpg","author":"kallerna","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/BTS_Skytrain_at_Victory_Monument.jpg/960px-BTS_Skytrain_at_Victory_Monument.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumb